{
  "title": "エージェントの作業状況（Claude・Codex）",
  "uid": "agent-sessions",
  "tags": [
    "agent-telemetry",
    "claude-code",
    "codex"
  ],
  "timezone": "browser",
  "schemaVersion": 39,
  "version": 1,
  "editable": true,
  "refresh": "1m",
  "time": {
    "from": "now-7d",
    "to": "now"
  },
  "templating": {
    "list": [
      {
        "name": "tool",
        "label": "ツール",
        "type": "query",
        "datasource": {
          "type": "prometheus",
          "uid": "prometheus"
        },
        "query": {
          "query": "label_values(agent_session_info, tool)",
          "refId": "tool"
        },
        "definition": "label_values(agent_session_info, tool)",
        "includeAll": true,
        "multi": true,
        "allValue": ".*",
        "refresh": 2,
        "sort": 1,
        "current": {
          "selected": true,
          "text": [
            "All"
          ],
          "value": [
            "$__all"
          ]
        }
      },
      {
        "name": "project",
        "label": "プロジェクト",
        "type": "query",
        "datasource": {
          "type": "prometheus",
          "uid": "prometheus"
        },
        "query": {
          "query": "label_values(agent_session_info{tool=~\"$tool\"}, project)",
          "refId": "project"
        },
        "definition": "label_values(agent_session_info{tool=~\"$tool\"}, project)",
        "includeAll": true,
        "multi": true,
        "allValue": ".*",
        "refresh": 2,
        "sort": 1,
        "current": {
          "selected": true,
          "text": [
            "All"
          ],
          "value": [
            "$__all"
          ]
        }
      }
    ]
  },
  "annotations": {
    "list": []
  },
  "panels": [
    {
      "id": 1,
      "type": "text",
      "title": "",
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 2,
        "w": 24,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 0
      },
      "options": {
        "mode": "markdown",
        "content": "対象は選択期間内に開始したセッションです。改善点は一覧を「再実行」「反復」「失敗」で並べ替えて探します。回数が多いだけで問題とは断定できません。"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "type": "stat",
      "title": "セッション数",
      "description": "",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "prometheus"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 4,
        "w": 4,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 2
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "prometheus"
          },
          "expr": "count by (tool) (agent_session_start_time_seconds{tool=~\"$tool\",project=~\"$project\"} >= ${__from:date:seconds})",
          "refId": "A",
          "legendFormat": "{{tool}}",
          "instant": true,
          "range": false,
          "format": "time_series"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "short",
          "color": {
            "mode": "palette-classic"
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "reduceOptions": {
          "calcs": [
            "lastNotNull"
          ],
          "fields": "",
          "values": false
        },
        "textMode": "value_and_name",
        "colorMode": "value",
        "graphMode": "none",
        "orientation": "horizontal"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "type": "stat",
      "title": "実作業時間",
      "description": "イベント間の時間を合計し、一定時間以上の無操作を除外します。",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "prometheus"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 4,
        "w": 4,
        "x": 4,
        "y": 2
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "prometheus"
          },
          "expr": "sum by (tool) (agent_session_active_seconds{tool=~\"$tool\",project=~\"$project\"} and on(tool,session_id,project) (agent_session_start_time_seconds{tool=~\"$tool\",project=~\"$project\"} >= ${__from:date:seconds}))",
          "refId": "A",
          "legendFormat": "{{tool}}",
          "instant": true,
          "range": false,
          "format": "time_series"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "s",
          "color": {
            "mode": "palette-classic"
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "reduceOptions": {
          "calcs": [
            "lastNotNull"
          ],
          "fields": "",
          "values": false
        },
        "textMode": "value_and_name",
        "colorMode": "value",
        "graphMode": "none",
        "orientation": "horizontal"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "type": "stat",
      "title": "トークン数（入力＋出力）",
      "description": "キャッシュの読み取り・書き込み分を除いた入力と、出力の合計です。費用を直接表すものではありません。",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "prometheus"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 4,
        "w": 4,
        "x": 8,
        "y": 2
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "prometheus"
          },
          "expr": "sum by (tool) (agent_session_tokens{tool=~\"$tool\",project=~\"$project\",type=~\"input|output\"} and on(tool,session_id,project) (agent_session_start_time_seconds{tool=~\"$tool\",project=~\"$project\"} >= ${__from:date:seconds}))",
          "refId": "A",
          "legendFormat": "{{tool}}",
          "instant": true,
          "range": false,
          "format": "time_series"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "short",
          "color": {
            "mode": "palette-classic"
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "reduceOptions": {
          "calcs": [
            "lastNotNull"
          ],
          "fields": "",
          "values": false
        },
        "textMode": "value_and_name",
        "colorMode": "value",
        "graphMode": "none",
        "orientation": "horizontal"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 5,
      "type": "stat",
      "title": "キャッシュヒット率",
      "description": "入力側トークンに占めるキャッシュ読み取りの割合です。",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "prometheus"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 4,
        "w": 4,
        "x": 12,
        "y": 2
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "prometheus"
          },
          "expr": "sum by (tool) (agent_session_tokens{tool=~\"$tool\",project=~\"$project\",type=\"cache_read\"} and on(tool,session_id,project) (agent_session_start_time_seconds{tool=~\"$tool\",project=~\"$project\"} >= ${__from:date:seconds})) / sum by (tool) (agent_session_tokens{tool=~\"$tool\",project=~\"$project\",type=~\"input|cache_read|cache_creation\"} and on(tool,session_id,project) (agent_session_start_time_seconds{tool=~\"$tool\",project=~\"$project\"} >= ${__from:date:seconds}))",
          "refId": "A",
          "legendFormat": "{{tool}}",
          "instant": true,
          "range": false,
          "format": "time_series"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "percentunit",
          "color": {
            "mode": "palette-classic"
          },
          "decimals": 1
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "reduceOptions": {
          "calcs": [
            "lastNotNull"
          ],
          "fields": "",
          "values": false
        },
        "textMode": "value_and_name",
        "colorMode": "value",
        "graphMode": "none",
        "orientation": "horizontal"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 6,
      "type": "stat",
      "title": "ツール失敗率",
      "description": "ツール呼び出しのうち失敗した割合です。失敗の原因はここだけでは分かりません。",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "prometheus"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 4,
        "w": 4,
        "x": 16,
        "y": 2
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "prometheus"
          },
          "expr": "sum by (tool) (agent_session_tool_failures{tool=~\"$tool\",project=~\"$project\"} and on(tool,session_id,project) (agent_session_start_time_seconds{tool=~\"$tool\",project=~\"$project\"} >= ${__from:date:seconds})) / sum by (tool) (agent_session_tool_calls{tool=~\"$tool\",project=~\"$project\"} and on(tool,session_id,project) (agent_session_start_time_seconds{tool=~\"$tool\",project=~\"$project\"} >= ${__from:date:seconds}))",
          "refId": "A",
          "legendFormat": "{{tool}}",
          "instant": true,
          "range": false,
          "format": "time_series"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "percentunit",
          "color": {
            "mode": "palette-classic"
          },
          "decimals": 1
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "reduceOptions": {
          "calcs": [
            "lastNotNull"
          ],
          "fields": "",
          "values": false
        },
        "textMode": "value_and_name",
        "colorMode": "value",
        "graphMode": "none",
        "orientation": "horizontal"
      }
    },
    {
